      <activity id="3d33afb5-d014-570b-bb8a-1cb8bfc6cae0" activityNameId="943b052c-161f-5e83-8c7c-ad425134d37c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Calcium borates, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Calcium borates, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of calcium borate. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
CAS number: 012291-65-5; 
Formula: Ca2B6O11 . 5H2O; 
UUID: 2b963bc1-059d-3a35-a2b6-ade92d4d4b11
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions.
Location: Data used represent conditions in Turkey.
Technology: Data approximated with data from iron mining as well as lime crushing and milling. Land-use data based on conditions for sodium borates.
Time period: date of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2b963bc1-059d-3a35-a2b6-ade92d4d4b11.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
